                    "text": "The main command includes the gate screen and the 25K selection before resuming three arms to 100K. Promotion continues the matched pair with their AdamW moments. The measured 250K run consumed 6,420 unique examples per arm. One user-wide GPU lease serializes workers. To inspect a running study from a second terminal, use `python -m loopqwen resources`. The scheduled arm and immutable checkpoint pointers are under `outputs/phase3/configs/` and `checkpoints/p3_*/targets-*.json`. The [experiment registry](EXPERIMENT_REGISTRY.md) includes the evaluation and report commands, and the [results](PHASE3_RESULTS.md) explain why confirmation stayed sealed."
